exclude	bid128_erf	not an IEEE 754-2019 operation
exclude	bid128_erfc	not an IEEE 754-2019 operation
exclude	bid128_exp2	IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 recommended operation, not implemented
exclude	bid128_fdim	C99 <math.h> helper with no IEEE 754 counterpart in the core
exclude	bid128_frexp	C99 <math.h> helper with no IEEE 754 counterpart in the core (two results)
exclude	bid128_hypot	IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 recommended operation, not implemented
exclude	bid128_ilogb	integer-result logB — not implemented; bid128_logb covers the value
exclude	bid128_inf	special-value constructor — out of scope (library builds these directly)
exclude	bid128_isCanonical	isCanonical over a UBD value is always true (754-conformant: UBD admits only canonical representations). Intel tests BID-encoding canonicality, which is normalized away at decode per 754-2019 — not a property of a decoded value, so not expressible through d128_isCanonical (which is correctly a `{ true }` stub).
exclude	bid128_lgamma	not an IEEE 754-2019 operation
exclude	bid128_log2	IEEE 754-2019 §9.2 recommended operation, not implemented (log2p1 is)
exclude	bid128_modf	C99 <math.h> helper with no IEEE 754 counterpart in the core (two results)
exclude	bid128_nan	special-value constructor — out of scope (library builds these directly)
exclude	bid128_nextafter	nextafter/nexttoward — declined (not in IEEE 754-2019; see decision log)
exclude	bid128_nexttoward	nextafter/nexttoward — declined (not in IEEE 754-2019; see decision log)
exclude	bid128_quantum	754 quantum as a decimal (1E q) — not implemented; quantexp covers the exponent
exclude	bid128_radix	radix() constant accessor — trivially 10; not a test-worthy operation
exclude	bid128_sin	trig/inverse-trig — not required by IEEE 754-2019 decimal
